name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q3_2026-pilot'

question 'A student asks an AI image generator to create a picture of "a scientist." The AI produces images showing mostly men. What does this most likely tell us about the AI?'

right 'The AI was trained on data that did not equally represent all scientists, so it learned a biased pattern.'
wrong 'The AI is programmed to prefer certain types of images over others.'
wrong 'The AI cannot generate pictures of women.'
wrong 'The AI is broken and needs to be restarted.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

